# Public website entry

Follow `/AGENTS.md` and the user's current approved request. Read `/docs/SPOKEDU_PUBLIC_WEBSITE_SSOT.md` for product meaning and `/app/spokedu/docs/PUBLIC_MARKETING_DESIGN_CONTRACT.md` for the applicable approved visual reference. A newer explicit reference/request supersedes older visual composition within its scope.

Navigation labels/order and header/footer actions are owned by `app/spokedu/data/site.ts`; canonical route values by `app/spokedu/data/public-routes.ts`; route compatibility by `next.config.ts`. Do not restore a historical menu or CTA from this adapter or an old QA script. Page structure, CSS classes and internal component names are not protected behavior.

